 *     an3_acx7100-48l  et-0/0/0.400
 *     ma5_mx204  xe-0/1/4.400
 *     meg1_acx7100-32c  et-0/0/26:0.400
 *
 * Variables (example values from ma5_mx204 / vpls_group_108_800):
 *   $INSTANCE_NAME      e.g. vpls_group_108_800
