/*
 * Topic:   Colour-mapped resolution schemes alongside an L3VPN RIB resolution import
 * Seen on:
 *   Junos: ma4_mx204 mse2_mx304
 *   EVO:   ma3_acx7100-48l meg1_acx7100-32c meg2_acx7509
 * Count:
